  "fullDescription": "Luxury Charm is a classic serif font with stylish ligatures. With a classic all-caps serif as uppercase letters and stylish modern serif as lowercase letters. You can use the lowercase at the beginning of a word or in the middle for a stylish and modern look. The beautiful ligatures, which uniquely combine two characters between lowercase and uppercase, add a touch of luxury and delicacy to your project. This versatile font is perfect for logos, branding, quotes, and even wedding invitations. Plus, it supports multiple languages!",
